{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（20日）早上9時正，警方接獲保安員報案，指尖沙咀美麗都大廈一個電錶房冒煙。消防到場出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，並於約21分鐘後將火救熄。事件中無人受傷，中電人員到場檢查，正調查火警成因。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防到場撲救。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189151425960087552937541.jpeg/T2t1Hgjrz-iCHPgNvH1S13q3d7CVQgBtSZEqvmyRKr4\"/><figcaption>消防到場撲救。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"尖沙咀美麗都大廈一個電錶房冒煙。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189153877358809088287396.jpeg/9r0bULLjqzDqMxyf4exnqELc7y9tVABC5ND1SM7Q9Ug\"/><figcaption>尖沙咀美麗都大廈一個電錶房冒煙。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場撲救。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189151290458902528210943.jpeg/UIDv8AXEkt_WJ-hn2p4gaaQZruEIcGcI0aqKXvSqil4\"/><figcaption>消防到場撲救。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場撲救。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189151293311160320613809.jpeg/H0z6UYjBSlOypCx4GYcFazWFyFvWhHE4z5rJ4-qayeM\"/><figcaption>消防到場撲救。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189151296117280768936841.jpeg/B1Wnj7vMKRBwUMnPx-nWhY1fc7zNt7j-atFyrU_Rcq0\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是美麗都大廈。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189151298906624000295367.jpeg/0b0WTASTGJVCIS2QzQioQfY_KcSv3BJr8_vYVtb72FY\"/><figcaption>現場是美麗都大廈。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中電人員到場檢查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189151301607886848396218.jpeg/OYoIzF_RM0-PO-4-LecyrAP5m5PWZKz1B1jqBCJY6gQ\"/><figcaption>中電人員到場檢查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.809597+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T02:03:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T12:18:37.769507+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:14.